en  hogwarts legacy  and the upcoming fantastic beasts movie  which was originally scheduled to  release in  2021 but has now been bumped to 2022  for reasons we won't get into here so  this could have thrown a wrench into  their ultimate marketing plans for the  game and now they're needing to adjust  from everything we've seen so far though  i don't think there's any reason for us  to be concerned or worried about the  game's development  it just seems like we'll have to keep  waiting for new information and you know  exactly where you can find that new  information right here we'll make sure  to bring new videos to you  anytime if it's even a tweet a new  screenshot  we'll make sure to do a new video as  always thank you guys so much for  watching  i'll talk to you again soon
 

